    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join Us:    </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Introduction</h2><strong>&quot;To the Grave&quot; is a horror and hilarious puzzle game that you have never experienced before! </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200340/extras/9c46257c13b6f5fc56dea673b3802369.avif?t=1749053534\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> &quot;To the Grave&quot; has been praised by anchors as a new type of game and an innovative work of horror games that cannot be missed.<br></li><li> You will face various weird monsters and absurd ways of death, which will make you laugh and make you creepy.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200340/extras/acc13633d5955d1ac857b11a6eff0d36.avif?t=1749053534\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The diverse characters make the game process more fun.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200340/extras/443db084975b6b2cb02a63126919fdca.avif?t=1749053534\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You will also encounter many interesting monsters during the entire journey. Don't be afraid. Although they look scary, they will definitely become the source of your happiness.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200340/extras/932653479fa83d27c5199ab29829c085.avif?t=1749053534\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The girl woke up from a car accident and forgot everything. She accidentally broke into a mysterious village and encountered many murders.<br></li><li> You will experience a thrilling suspense story in a horror atmosphere full of oriental elements.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200340/extras/2c38324b3ff165e4f132e75b6978e7a2.avif?t=1749053534\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> All the puzzles in the game are closely related to the game story, making the game experience more smooth.</li></ul>",
